WEBVTT

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.650
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.180
In this wide world

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:28.350
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:34.930
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:38.560
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.670
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.640
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:55.950
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.710
Awaken now

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:12.030
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:19.270
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.040
It's certain

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:26.410
Woh woh

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:33.920
Go get 'em!
KANPAN MAN
Devil King Sauce's Counterattack

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.790
Go get 'em!
KANPAN MAN
Devil King Sauce's Counterattack
Go get 'em! KANPAN MAN!

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.120
Oh, my...

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.230
We were just getting to the good part!

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:43.430
Well, this thing IS pretty long in the tooth.

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:47.420
You do need to give it a break now and then...

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:50.340
But what will we do?

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:53.000
There's going to be a rerun of
that samurai drama soon.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:58.740
But (the rebroadcast of) Fangs of the
Inner Palace is the only thing I live for!

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:01.380
I think that's exaggerating just a LITTLE...

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:03.620
It might make Urd cry.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:05.090
Oh yeah.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.440
Plum blossoms...

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:29.880
Ah! A Goddess's Tears
and His Dream!

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:34.910
Here, this is in return for the present
you gave me. Do you like it?

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.820
This ring can only be found
in the Northlands.

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:42.690
Hey, c'mon! You could at least
act a little excited.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:43.790
Urd.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:44.930
Yeah?

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.560
It's been on my mind for a while now...
but we can't stay like this.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:49.460
Huh?!

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.100
I believe I'll be going on a journey.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.800
No! But why now all of a sudden?!

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.510
You're a wonderful woman,

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:01.340
but is it all right for us to be spending
such idle time together like this?

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.480
What are you talking about?!

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:03.850
Aren't you the one who said to me,

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.040
"Any time I spend with you is time
that shall not go to waste"?

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:09.020
That was how I felt then.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:12.920
We must live each day progressing
towards our dreams.

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.760
That is why I am going on a journey...

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.920
in pursuit of an eternally romantic ideal.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.030
Please understand, Urd.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.800
I don't understand at all!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:22.920
Farewell!

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.700
Whoa, wait! You can't fly, right?

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.760
Troubadour!

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.410
Why would I remember him now?

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:40.110
That jerk who left me...

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:44.150
She's looking unusually gloomy.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:48.360
She gets like this every year,
around this time.

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:51.660
Do the plum blossoms have
anything to do with it?

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:57.020
It's because plum blossoms have
special meaning to Urd.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.900
I didn't know that...

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.770
Looking back now, it's a good thing
I broke up with him.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:14.970
Well, now. I've got (the rebroadcast of)
Fangs of the Inner Palace to watch!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.520
This cloud of blossoms...

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.130
No, it couldn't be...

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:31.090
But, there's no mistaking it!

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.030
The plum spirit...

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:44.470
Troubadour!

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:48.580
I've been searching for you, Urd...

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.190
Who's he?

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:58.820
A plum spirit, who used to be Urd's lover.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.990
But I had heard they broke up...

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:05.030
Why would he be here now?

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:10.830
I have come here so that we might
once again share our love.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:20.450
Go home. Who do you think you
are showing up here now?

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:23.180
We were both young back then.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.020
I'm STILL young!

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.710
Yeah, I agree.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:32.360
Your beauty is eternal...
as are my feelings for you!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:40.360
OH, URD! HEAR MY SONG!

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.170
OUR LOVE IS ETERNAL! FOREVER!

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:49.140
I've already told you that
I can't stand that crap!
OUR LOVE IS ETERNAL! FOREVER!

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:49.640
I've already told you that
I can't stand that crap!

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:51.640
Whoa, stop it!

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:53.610
A man!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:54.970
Keiichi!

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:57.950
What's the meaning of this then?

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:01.250
What is a goddess doing in the
company of a mere mortal?!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.760
I'd like to know who you think YOU are
crashing in on my home all of a sudden!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.760
You have a great deal of nerve
to speak so brazenly to me!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:14.130
You're the one who has a lot of nerve to drop in
on us without even saying who you are!

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:18.140
All land is but part of the path
I tread on my journey!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.810
That's ridiculous!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.280
Does being a god entitle you
to do whatever you like?

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:24.580
Silence, you lowly HUMAN!

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.780
Don't trifle with me!

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.220
Is that any kind of way for
a god to be talking?!

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.950
Right now, I am obliged to stay
at this man's house.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:37.450
W-What?! You're living under
the same roof as this man?!

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:40.450
Well, that's pretty much what it amounts to.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.050
What?

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.260
Unforgivable!

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:48.470
I will not tolerate you
associating with my Urd...

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.060
Bug Summoning Song!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:55.640
Well, a-bugs, bugs, bugs,
bugs bugs, hey, bugs...

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:55.840
What the heck...

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.380
What the heck...
Bugs, bugs, bugs, hey, bugs, bugs and bugs!

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:58.410
Bugs, bugs, bugs, hey, bugs, bugs and bugs!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.510
This song!
Bugs, bugs, bugs, hey, bugs, bugs and bugs!

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:05.820
Buggy bugs and bugs and bugs,
bugs, bugs, ba-bugs...

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.580
Enough is enough!

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:16.330
She didn't hold back on that one.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.920
For cryin' out loud...

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.370
He might come off as a total flake,

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:24.740
but the power of his songs of malediction
are on the level of a First Class deity.

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:26.970
But, this guy is, like, Urd's...

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:32.970
Well, back in the past we...
we dated, but ONLY for a little while!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.350
Ooh! Wow! AND?

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.080
I said it was only for a LITTLE while!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.950
I guess it makes sense, right?

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:44.320
Nothing strange about Urd
having a boyfriend or two.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:49.730
More importantly... I think you'd
better watch your back, Keiichi.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:50.600
Huh?

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:53.770
He's the violent type, and very jealous...

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:58.070
I wonder what became of all the guys
who have made a move on me...

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.240
Bugs, bugs, ba-bugs, bugs, ba-bugs...

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:03.080
Troubadour's songs of malediction have
made caterpillars and scaly insects
Bugs, bugs, ba-bugs, bugs, ba-bugs...

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.880
Troubadour's songs of malediction have
made caterpillars and scaly insects
Buggy bugs and bugs

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.880
burst out of the bodies of the men
who have come on to me.
And bugs, bugs, bugs, ba-bugs...

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.610
and bugs, bugs, bugs, ba-bugs...

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:13.990
Well, in that case, I'd appreciate it
if he'd peacefully withdraw...

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:17.190
Look, just don't say anything
careless that'd provoke him.

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.220
I haven't made any careless remarks
I'd feel guilty about now!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.770
Troubadour is the kind of guy who won't
stop once he's made up his mind.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.730
Well, I guess the two of you are
alike at least in that respect.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.300
Keiichi!

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.900
Yup, they really are alike.

00:08:35.810 --> 00:08:38.780
Still, you haven't seen him for
a long time, you know.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:41.980
You look kind of happy...

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:45.450
Ah! He recovered!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:48.190
Mortal!

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:52.250
Basically, all I must do is defeat you,
and Urd will return to me, right?

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:56.060
If you also consider yourself a man, then
consider fighting and falling gracefully!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.860
So "falling" is foregone conclusion, huh?

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:01.670
I can see how he is Urd's ex-boyfriend.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.370
He's very passionate, though, isn't he?

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:11.510
By the way, did you find that
golden nightingale thing?

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:14.140
Oh, so you remembered that?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:19.520
About that... it seems that it has lost
its way and wandered to Earth.

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:21.260
No kidding?

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:24.890
Then I found out that YOU
were on Earth, too!

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:28.500
Ah! If this is not fate, than what is?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.120
It's not fate at all. It's a COINCIDENCE.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:35.400
Well, go find your nightingale,
and then get your tush back to Heaven.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.770
That was cold.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.640
Come on now, don't be like that.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.370
Perhaps one of my songs would
make you reconsider...

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:42.600
Not interested.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.480
It's a song you said you love.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.250
I don't remember that.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.740
That cannot be. Please listen.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.450
Forget it!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:56.690
U-U-U-Urd!

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.730
You know what?

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:03.350
I'm not so petty as to stay attached
to what I already let go of.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.860
Urd!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.500
WHY, OH, WHY?! WHAT DON'T YOU
LIKE ABOUT ME, MY HONEY?!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.000
Be sure to leave when your song's over.
WHY, OH, WHY?! WHAT DON'T YOU
LIKE ABOUT ME, MY HONEY?!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:10.970
WHY, OH, WHY?! WHAT DON'T YOU
LIKE ABOUT ME, MY HONEY?!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.040
That was a beautiful song...

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.370
If she'd only listen to it!

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.610
Urd...

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.180
Of course it was a beautiful song.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.950
But, why won't it get through to Urd?

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.380
Even when I love her so much...

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:33.490
Troubadour... Urd hasn't seen
you for a long time,

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:36.220
so I think it's that she has simply
become a little stubborn.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.060
So try not to be discouraged, okay?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.740
You're saying I should show her even
stronger proof of my love, right?!

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:47.740
I'm sure it will convey your feelings to her.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:50.740
All right! I need to release a new single!

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:55.440
WORDS OF LOVE GUSH OUT OF ME
LIKE A DELUGE OF WATER!

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.920
Ahh... I'm so good it's scary.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:04.650
Urd! My love for you is infinite!

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:15.000
He doesn't seem like such
a bad guy after all,

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.160
but it'll be a problem if he's going
to stay here like this...

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:20.170
Things will be pretty lively
around here, won't they?

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:22.870
They're lively enough as it is.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.180
Say, why'd they break up anyway?

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:31.050
That's not important,
just fix the TV, quick...

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:34.920
Why? Why?! If you don't tell me,
I WON'T fix the TV!

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:35.760
She eats this kind of stuff up...

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:38.460
Why? How come? C'mon!
She eats this kind of stuff up...

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.390
Why? How come? C'mon!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:45.290
He found a dream beyond me, that's all...

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:50.660
You see, I want a guy who'll have
eyes for me and nothing else.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:54.040
He's not quite that right now.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:57.680
Why didn't you go along with him?

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:03.650
I was not a necessary part
of his dreams. Just that.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:07.920
Too bad I couldn't have been rid of
him once and for all, eh?

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.520
Maybe...

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:16.000
Okay, it's fixed! Some solder came off
the board, that's all.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.460
Wow! Awesome job!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.800
All right, and in the spotlight this week...

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.170
The minstrel of love, Troubadour!

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:30.910
Thank you for coming all the way
from Heaven to be with us tonight!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.110
My pleasure.

00:12:32.110 --> 00:12:32.510
Well, without any further ado,
let's hear his song!

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:34.810
What's he doing on a music show?
Well, without any further ado,
let's hear his song!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:43.680
OH, URD, MY PRECIOUS GODDESS!

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:52.930
OH HOW YOUR EYES CAPTIVATE ME, MY HONEY!

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:56.870
OH, URD!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:59.240
No! Stop! What the hell are you doing?!
THAT KEIICHI MORISATO IS A DIRTY RAT
WHO'S TRYING TO TRICK YOU!

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:05.510
THAT KEIICHI MORISATO IS A DIRTY RAT
WHO'S TRYING TO TRICK YOU!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.010
Was that Kei-chan he was just singing about?
THAT KEIICHI MORISATO IS A DIRTY RAT
WHO'S TRYING TO TRICK YOU!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:06.710
Was that Kei-chan he was just singing about?

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.250
Was that Kei-chan he was just singing about?
DON'T FALL FOR IT, LOOK AT NO OTHER BUT ME!

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.180
DON'T FALL FOR IT, LOOK AT NO OTHER BUT ME!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.750
Those lyrics are very to-the-point, aren't they?
DON'T FALL FOR IT, LOOK AT NO OTHER BUT ME!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:14.490
Urd, you've gotta do something about... huh?
DON'T FALL FOR IT, LOOK AT NO OTHER BUT ME!

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:15.090
U-Urd?
DON'T FALL FOR IT, LOOK AT NO OTHER BUT ME!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:15.920
U-Urd?
I AM A PRISONER OF YOUR LOVE!

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:21.690
I AM A PRISONER OF YOUR LOVE!

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:27.290
OHH, URD!

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.400
Summon Lightning Bolt!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.840
Huh? Why'd she do that?

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:39.710
Urd!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:40.770
Oh, my!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:56.790
C-Could this be part of Troubadour's act?

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:00.700
Oh, Urd! You heard my song, didn't you?

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.070
Yes, I heard it!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.040
Along with everyone else watching this
live national network broadcast!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.370
What the hell are you thinking?!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:10.010
I wanted to prove the depth
of my love for you!

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:13.110
And did you think I'd be delighted to
see you do something like this?!

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:14.580
Y-You mean you're not delighted?

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:15.650
This is the worst!

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:17.950
W-Why won't you understand?!

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.590
Because you won't LISTEN, just like now!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.820
I am a free man!

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.790
It is my pride as a plum spirit!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:27.190
And it's put me on the verge of tears
more times than I can count!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:30.130
What? You cry for me?

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:34.330
What are you talking about?
Why would I do that?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.770
This means I have not yet made
a big enough impression on you.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.770
Then listen to the second verse!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.340
OH, URD!

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:44.010
Summon lightning bolt!
OH, URD!

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:44.950
Summon lightning bolt!
URD, URAAAAAH!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:47.110
URD, URAAAAAH!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.980
I don't get it.

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:56.680
I thought she'd see how I feel
if I sang inside that box.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:15:03.460
Well... Beyond that and all else,
if my songs are unable to move her...

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:06.520
does it mean the lyrics were
no good? Hmm...

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.910
The nightingale's summoning song,
the "Scroll of the Golden Song"...

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:14.980
My dream is alive, right here
in the palm of my hand,

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.540
awaiting its awakening after
a single seal is broken.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:24.480
If I can obtain just one more heartfelt tear...

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:28.280
That is what I need you for, Urd.

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.750
He didn't come back after all.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:37.200
Wasn't that kinda cruel for such
a long-awaited reunion?

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:41.460
Your spells were perfect today, Urd.

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.300
If it had been Keiichi, he wouldn't
have lasted a second.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:48.740
He was trying so hard, you could at least
listen to his song, couldn't you?

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:50.710
It was a beautiful song!

